  dialogueInfo:
  - text: The armies are hidden by a fog of war, preventing us from knowing which
      soldier is which on the enemy side. The advantage is that they cannot see our
      soldiers either. You will see your own army normally, but the enemy soldiers
      will remain hidden.
    speaker: Blue King
    portraitLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ac773d46c729494c8a69bb01d146284, type: 3}
    portraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    myEvent:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    isRightPortrait: 0
    isDoublePortrait: 0
  - text: To win this war, we need to find the enemy's treasure, which is hidden
      somewhere among his army.
    speaker: Blue King
    portraitLeft: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ac773d46c729494c8a69bb01d146284, type: 3}
    portraitRight: {fileID: 0}
